    "diagnosis": "Small cell carcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Alcohol-fixed cytology smear shows single and loosely cohesive cells with a minimal amount of stripped cytoplasm, granular chromatin without prominent nucleoli, and multiple dark apoptotic/pyknotic cells. Nuclear streaking is prominent.",
